From ff70ec7d7067e633ad8ced3eed4cefdbcb55da14 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ruscher <rruscher@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 16:27:11 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] dockapps: Supports several placements, moving dock-apps
 between them.

For dock-apps attached to the Dock as well as to the Clip, as on Window
Maker:

* wlmaker_dockapps_create_with_key: The placement stores its order under
  its own key of the dock-apps state file (eg. "Dock", besides "Order"),
  keeping the other keys of the file.
* wlmaker_dockapps_insert, _detach and _move_to: Place a dock-app at a
  given index, or take it out (and forget its name), eg. when dragged from
  one dock to the other.
* wlmaker_dockapps_size, _index, _name and _has_name.
* wlmaker_dockapps_set_removed and _is_removed: The "Removed" array of the
  state file, for dock-apps the user dropped off the docks. A session can
  leave those out when starting dock-apps.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/dockapps.c | 386 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 src/dockapps.h |  86 +++++++++++
 2 files changed, 454 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)

